research support only. They do not constitute clinical advice, diagnosis, or
treatment recommendations.

Framework names (Oxford CEBM, GRADE, OpenEvidence, etc.) are used as proper
nouns for methodology reference. OpenEvidence-style grades produced by skills
in this repo are local heuristics and are not official OpenEvidence EvidenceGrade.
